  "tourAyahNumberDesc": "Danna lambar Ayah don samun damar ci gaban abubuwan da suka ci gaba:\n- Ƙimar ƙarfin hadda:\n  • Rauni\n  • Matsakaici\n  • Mai kyau\n- Ƙara alamar ayar\n- Duba Mutashabihat da ayar",
